<span style="flex: 1 1 320px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--ink)">noui.si</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted)">Own experiment · 2026 · Interfaces that form around what you need</span><span style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 10px"><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted)">React 19</span><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted)">View Transitions</span><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted)">Claude</span><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted)">Cloudflare</span></span><span class="card-link__cta" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink)">Case study<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span></span>
<span style="flex: 0 1 260px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink)">Three scenarios · a voice-to-voice prototype · an open-source orb</span>
