</a>
</li>
<li style="border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<a class="card-link" href="/work/accessibility" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px 32px; padding: 28px 0">
<span style="font-size: 44px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--accent); width: 72px; line-height: 1">03</span>
