<span style="flex: 1 1 360px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span class="card-link__cta" style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500">Accessibility</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted)">Proposed a CSS user preference for HDR brightness spikes and filed it with the W3C CSS Working Group.</span></span>
</a>
